### Contoso Bank API — request collection
### Used by the VS Code Azure Load Testing extension + GitHub Copilot (docs 09 & 10)
### to generate a Locust script from an artefact the API team already maintains.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@accountId = ACC-1001
@targetAccountId = ACC-1002

### Health probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Current demo configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/config

### 1. Balance enquiry — highest volume journey in retail banking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance
X-Correlation-Id: demo-balance-001

### 2. Transaction history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?page_size=20
X-Correlation-Id: demo-history-001

### 3. Payment initiation — the critical write path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-transfer-001

{
  "from_account": "{{accountId}}",
  "to_account": "{{targetAccountId}}",
  "amount_minor": 2500,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "reference": "Monthly standing order"
}

### 4. Statement generation — heavy reporting endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statements/{{accountId}}?months=3
X-Correlation-Id: demo-statement-001

### Switch to the bottlenecked configuration (demo "before")
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/config
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preset": "bottlenecked" }

### Switch to the optimised configuration (demo "after")
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/config
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preset": "optimized" }

### Reset seed data and counters between test runs
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reset
